{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/19102","id":3310148967,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLCAjRs7FTN1n","html_url":"https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/19102","diff_url":"https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/19102.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/19102.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/issues/19102","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/19102/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/19102/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/issues/19102/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/statuses/e91ca3c099161f10c3eb99e254d854583e95fd10","number":19102,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Introduce CUDA graph debug mode with breakable CUDA graph","user":{"login":"cctry","id":17473714,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDczNzE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17473714?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry","html_url":"https://github.com/cctry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Introduce **Breakable CUDA Graph** — a lightweight mechanism to insert graph breaks into CUDA graph capture. Marked operations run eagerly between captured graph segments, while the rest stays graph-captured.\r\n\r\n## CUDA graph debug mode\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Debug mode: all ops run eagerly through graph capture/replay path\r\npython -m sglang.launch_server --model meta-llama/Llama-3-8B --debug-cuda-graph\r\n```\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# Selective graph breaks in model code\r\nfrom sglang.srt.model_executor.breakable_cuda_graph.breakable_cuda_graph import non_graph\r\n\r\n@non_graph(enable=True)\r\ndef my_dynamic_op(x):\r\n    return some_incompatible_op(x)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Breakable CUDA graph\r\nwhen enable `SGLANG_USE_BREAKABLE_CUDA_GRAPH`, the decode graph is breakable. The overhead is minimal if no graph break inserted.\r\n","labels":[{"id":6403845273,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLCAjRs8AAAABfbLsmQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"Improvements or additions to documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true},{"id":9283445059,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLCAjRs8AAAACKVYhQw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/labels/run-ci","name":"run-ci","description":"","color":"9FE30D","default":false}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-21T03:18:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T07:36:58Z","closed_at":"2026-04-11T07:36:56Z","merged_at":"2026-04-11T07:36:56Z","merge_commit_sha":"f855a0bde6c9db10212183261be1f355977d9ea3","assignee":{"login":"cctry","id":17473714,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDczNzE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17473714?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry","html_url":"https://github.com/cctry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cctry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cct